        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black 15-3/4 Inch Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 15-3/4 Inch Black Flush Pull is hot, with its rectangular shape and on trend matte black finish. This flush pull can be mounted vertically or horizontally on pocket doors or lightweight drawers on cabinets or dressers. The Extra Long Matte Black 15-3/4 Inch Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull installs with the use of two screws (one at each end) for a secure fit.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-718-400-P22-specifications.gif?v=1704442284\" width=\"593\" height=\"234\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-718/400-P22 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/11-13-16-inch-black-flush-pull\"><b>11-13/16\" Black Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 15-3/4 Stainless Steel Flush Pull in Black:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 15-3/4\" (400 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/16\" (56 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\" (13 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/16\" (11 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 14-9/16\" (370 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Width: 1-1/32\" (26 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 15-1/2\" (394 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-15/16\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\">Flush Pulls</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
